 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 510767,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Consider the data in the following table representing world record fastest times for the 100 m sprint and the year in which each occurred, from 1912 through 2002:<br>\n<table style=\"width: 50%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><b>Year</b></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><b>Time</b></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">1912</td>\n<td align=\"right\">10.6</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">1921</td>\n<td align=\"right\">10.4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">1930</td>\n<td align=\"right\">10.3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">1936</td>\n<td align=\"right\">10.2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">1956</td>\n<td align=\"right\">10.1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">1960</td>\n<td align=\"right\">10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">1968</td>\n<td align=\"right\">9.95</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">1983</td>\n<td align=\"right\">9.93</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">1988</td>\n<td align=\"right\">9.92</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">1991</td>\n<td align=\"right\">9.9</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">1991</td>\n<td align=\"right\">9.86</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">1994</td>\n<td align=\"right\">9.85</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">1996</td>\n<td align=\"right\">9.84</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">1999</td>\n<td align=\"right\">9.79</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody><caption>100-Meter Spring Records</caption>\n</table>\nUsing software such as Excel, Python, or similar tools, the regression line can be found. For this data, the linear model would be <span data-math=\"\\widehat y=-0.00769x+10.55\"></span>, where <span data-math=\"x\"></span> is years since 1900. Compute the MAE, MAPE, MSE, and RMSE for this model.\n",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "MAE = 0.0415. MAPE = 0.41%. MSE = 0.003126. RMSE = 0.0559."
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "The information is collected in the following table. Excel can be used to perform the calculations.<br>\n<table class=\"unnumbered full-width\" style=\"width: 70%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\"></td>\n<td align=\"left\"></td>\n<td align=\"left\"></td>\n<td align=\"left\">Linear</td>\n<td align=\"left\">Abs. Error</td>\n<td align=\"left\">% Error</td>\n<td align=\"left\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">Year</td>\n<td align=\"left\">x</td>\n<td align=\"left\">Time (y)</td>\n<td align=\"left\">Model (y^)</td>\n<td align=\"left\">|y-y^|</td>\n<td align=\"left\">E/y</td>\n<td align=\"left\">E^2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"right\">1912</td>\n<td align=\"right\">12</td>\n<td align=\"right\">10.6</td>\n<td align=\"right\">10.45772</td>\n<td align=\"right\">0.14228</td>\n<td align=\"right\">0.013423</td>\n<td align=\"right\">0.020244</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"right\">1921</td>\n<td align=\"right\">21</td>\n<td align=\"right\">10.4</td>\n<td align=\"right\">10.38851</td>\n<td align=\"right\">0.01149</td>\n<td align=\"right\">0.001105</td>\n<td align=\"right\">0.000132</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"right\">1930</td>\n<td align=\"right\">30</td>\n<td align=\"right\">10.3</td>\n<td align=\"right\">10.3193</td>\n<td align=\"right\">0.0193</td>\n<td align=\"right\">0.001874</td>\n<td align=\"right\">0.000372</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"right\">1936</td>\n<td align=\"right\">36</td>\n<td align=\"right\">10.2</td>\n<td align=\"right\">10.27316</td>\n<td align=\"right\">0.07316</td>\n<td align=\"right\">0.007173</td>\n<td align=\"right\">0.005352</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"right\">1956</td>\n<td align=\"right\">56</td>\n<td align=\"right\">10.1</td>\n<td align=\"right\">10.11936</td>\n<td align=\"right\">0.01936</td>\n<td align=\"right\">0.001917</td>\n<td align=\"right\">0.000375</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"right\">1960</td>\n<td align=\"right\">60</td>\n<td align=\"right\">10</td>\n<td align=\"right\">10.0886</td>\n<td align=\"right\">0.0886</td>\n<td align=\"right\">0.00886</td>\n<td align=\"right\">0.00785</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"right\">1968</td>\n<td align=\"right\">68</td>\n<td align=\"right\">9.95</td>\n<td align=\"right\">10.02708</td>\n<td align=\"right\">0.07708</td>\n<td align=\"right\">0.007747</td>\n<td align=\"right\">0.005941</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"right\">1983</td>\n<td align=\"right\">83</td>\n<td align=\"right\">9.93</td>\n<td align=\"right\">9.91173</td>\n<td align=\"right\">0.01827</td>\n<td align=\"right\">0.00184</td>\n<td align=\"right\">0.000334</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"right\">1988</td>\n<td align=\"right\">88</td>\n<td align=\"right\">9.92</td>\n<td align=\"right\">9.87328</td>\n<td align=\"right\">0.04672</td>\n<td align=\"right\">0.00471</td>\n<td align=\"right\">0.002183</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"right\">1991</td>\n<td align=\"right\">91</td>\n<td align=\"right\">9.9</td>\n<td align=\"right\">9.85021</td>\n<td align=\"right\">0.04979</td>\n<td align=\"right\">0.005029</td>\n<td align=\"right\">0.002479</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"right\">1991</td>\n<td align=\"right\">91</td>\n<td align=\"right\">9.86</td>\n<td align=\"right\">9.85021</td>\n<td align=\"right\">0.00979</td>\n<td align=\"right\">0.000993</td>\n<td align=\"right\">9.58E-05</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"right\">1994</td>\n<td align=\"right\">94</td>\n<td align=\"right\">9.85</td>\n<td align=\"right\">9.82714</td>\n<td align=\"right\">0.02286</td>\n<td align=\"right\">0.002321</td>\n<td align=\"right\">0.000523</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"right\">1996</td>\n<td align=\"right\">96</td>\n<td align=\"right\">9.84</td>\n<td align=\"right\">9.81176</td>\n<td align=\"right\">0.02824</td>\n<td align=\"right\">0.00287</td>\n<td align=\"right\">0.000797</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"right\">1999</td>\n<td align=\"right\">99</td>\n<td align=\"right\">9.79</td>\n<td align=\"right\">9.78869</td>\n<td align=\"right\">0.00131</td>\n<td align=\"right\">0.000134</td>\n<td align=\"right\">1.72E-06</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"right\">2002</td>\n<td align=\"right\">102</td>\n<td align=\"right\">9.78</td>\n<td align=\"right\">9.76562</td>\n<td align=\"right\">0.01438</td>\n<td align=\"right\">0.00147</td>\n<td align=\"right\">0.000207</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"right\"></td>\n<td align=\"right\"></td>\n<td align=\"right\"></td>\n<td align=\"right\"></td>\n<td align=\"right\">0.041509</td>\n<td align=\"right\">0.004098</td>\n<td align=\"right\">0.003126</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"right\"></td>\n<td align=\"right\"></td>\n<td align=\"right\"></td>\n<td align=\"right\"></td>\n<td align=\"right\"></td>\n<td align=\"right\"></td>\n<td align=\"right\">0.055909</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n\n</table>\nAverages<br>\nSq. Root<br>\nMAE <span data-math=\"=\\frac1n\\sum_{i=1}^n{\\vert y_i-{\\widehat y}_i\\vert}\"></span> = Average of the absolute errors = 0.0415<br>\nMAPE <span data-math=\"=\\frac1n\\sum_{i=1}^n\\vert\\frac{y_i-{\\widehat y}_i}{y_i}\\vert\"></span> = Average of the percentage errors = 0.004098, or 0.4098% (rounded to 0.41%)<br>\nRSE = <span data-math=\"\\frac1n\\sum_{i=1}^n{(y_i-{\\widehat y}_i)^2}\"></span> = Average of the squared errors = 0.003126<br>\nRMSE <span data-math=\"=\\sqrt{\\frac1n\\sum_{i=1}^n{(y_i-{\\widehat y}_i)^2}}\"></span> = Square root of RSE <span data-math=\"=\\sqrt{0.003126}=0.0559\"></span>"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
